from one of these.

00:03:15.928 --> 00:03:17.096
-Oh, nice.

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.365
-These are all single people,
apparently.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.833
[ Laughter ]
-Apparently.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.936
-Maybe they're dating now.

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.904
