on the big screen."

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:37.883
[ Applause ]
-Aww!

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:39.985
-Come on!
-Come on.

00:03:39.985 --> 00:03:41.020
"Here you go. That's you."

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.454
-"There you go. Look at you."

00:03:42.454 --> 00:03:43.790
