00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:47.693
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.693 --> 00:03:51.697
-This one is
from @kamie92643518.

00:03:51.697 --> 00:03:56.035
She says, "My ex and I did
laundry together and we broke up

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.904
