Barbra Streilamb.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:31.537
-Yeah. For a second,
you were like, "What?"

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.307
-"What, Barbra Streisand?"
-Barbra Streilamb.

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:35.941
