00:04:35.941 --> 00:04:37.242
-I like Barbra Streilamb.

00:04:37.242 --> 00:04:39.211
-Huge fan.

00:04:39.211 --> 00:04:40.313
-She says --
[ Laughs ]

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:41.713
